<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="git-addon-ignore-files-and-folders">
    <title>Project version control</title>
    <shortdesc>Use the ignore actions on <uicontrol
      conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs0-git-staging-view"/> to
    automatically add patterns to the project <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>, as well as open
    it.</shortdesc>
    <conbody>
    <p>The Git Client lets you add files, folders, and extensions to the project
        <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>
    </p>
        <p>Project ignore actions apply to the current repository. All automatic ignore actions add
      paths or patterns to the project <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>file.</p>
        <section id="git-addon-add-files-to-project-gitignore-automatically">
      <title>Add patterns to project <codeph>.gitignore</codeph> automatically</title>
      <p>To access the automatic ignore actions, follow these steps:<ol id="ol_vjg_nkn_njc">
          <li>On <menucascade><uicontrol
              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs0-git-staging-view"/><uicontrol
              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs1-unstaged-files"/></menucascade>, select
            the files and folders you want to exclude from project version control.</li>
          <li>Right-click anywhere on <uicontrol
              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs1-unstaged-files"/> to open
            the context menu. </li>
          <li>In the context menu, select <uicontrol
              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/>.<ol
              id="ol_uwm_cln_njc">
              <li>If you select multiple items, the Git Client adds them to the project
                  <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>.</li>
              <li>If you select a file or folder, choose an action from the <uicontrol
                  conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/> submenu. Your
                available actions depend on whether you select a file or folder.<p>
                  <table frame="all" rowsep="1" colsep="1" id="table_gbw_2nn_njc">
                    <title>Actions that ignore files</title>
                    <tgroup cols="3">
                      <colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" colwidth="1*"/>
                      <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" colwidth="1*"/>
                      <colspec colnum="3" colname="newCol3" colwidth="1*"/>
                      <thead>
                        <row>
                          <entry>Action</entry>
                          <entry>To access</entry>
                          <entry>Excludes</entry>
                        </row>
                      </thead>
                      <tbody>
                        <row>
                          <entry><uicontrol
                              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore-file"
                            /></entry>
                          <entry>Select a file</entry>
                          <entry>The selected file</entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                          <entry><uicontrol
                              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore-by-extension"
                            /></entry>
                          <entry>Select a file</entry>
                          <entry>Files with the same extension as the selected file</entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                          <entry><uicontrol
                              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ign-dir-1-ignore-all-files"
                            /></entry>
                          <entry>Select a folder</entry>
                          <entry>All files in the selected folder</entry>
                        </row>
                      </tbody>
                    </tgroup>
                  </table>
                </p><p>
                  <table frame="all" rowsep="1" colsep="1" id="table_jdz_fb4_njc">
                    <title>Actions that ignore folders</title>
                    <tgroup cols="3">
                      <colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" colwidth="1*"/>
                      <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" colwidth="1*"/>
                      <colspec colnum="3" colname="newCol3" colwidth="1*"/>
                      <thead>
                        <row>
                          <entry>Action</entry>
                          <entry>To access</entry>
                          <entry>Excludes</entry>
                        </row>
                      </thead>
                      <tbody>
                        <row>
                          <entry><uicontrol
                              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ign-dir-0-ignore-dir"
                            /></entry>
                          <entry>Select a folder</entry>
                          <entry>The selected folder and its contents</entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                          <entry><uicontrol
                              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore-parent-dir"
                            /></entry>
                          <entry>Select a file</entry>
                          <entry>The selected folder and its contents</entry>
                        </row>
                      </tbody>
                    </tgroup>
                  </table>
                </p></li>
            </ol></li>
        </ol></p>
      <p>The selected file or folder no longer appears on <uicontrol
          conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs1-unstaged-files"/> and its
        pattern is added to the project <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>.</p>
    </section>
    </conbody>
</concept>
